  "description": "Zero-dependency PDF generation library. Writes PDF 1.4 and 2.0 with embedded TrueType fonts, JPEG and raster images, vector graphics, tables, PDF/A conformance, and hyperlink annotations. Native AOT verified in CI (publish + run a real AOT binary) with no native binaries — ideal for serverless and containers. Targets .NET Standard 2.0, .NET 6, .NET 8, and .NET 10. Fork of Majorsilence Reporting (Apache-2.0) with ReportViewer-compatible rendering of mixed run formatting and last-line overflow.",
